# Files excluded from the EAS build upload.
#
# EAS uploads the project directory (not a git archive), so without this
# the upload includes node_modules -- 1.6 GB, several minutes of
# uploading, and a build that spends most of its time on the transfer.
# The builder runs `npm ci` itself, so the installed tree is not needed.
node_modules/

# Metro / build artifacts. The builder regenerates both.
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
android/
ios/

# Native build outputs.
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.app

# Local environment. EAS gets its values from the EAS environment, not
# from this file -- and .env holds a development backend URL.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local tooling state.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.pem
